<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS4.SSS1" title="In IV-D Ablation Study ‣ IV Experiments ‣ VideoTG-R1: Boosting Video Temporal Grounding via Curriculum Reinforcement Learning on Reflected Boundary Annotations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">IV-D</span>1 </span>Ablation of different modules</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS4.SSS2" title="In IV-D Ablation Study ‣ IV Experiments ‣ VideoTG-R1: Boosting Video Temporal Grounding via Curriculum Reinforcement Learning on Reflected Boundary Annotations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">IV-D</span>2 </span>Ablation of boundary reflection agent</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS4.SSS3" title="In IV-D Ablation Study ‣ IV Experiments ‣ VideoTG-R1: Boosting Video Temporal Grounding via Curriculum Reinforcement Learning on Reflected Boundary Annotations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">IV-D</span>3 </span>Ablation of curriculum RL strategy</span></a></li>
