<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">VideoTG-R1: Boosting Video Temporal Grounding via Curriculum Reinforcement Learning on Reflected Boundary Annotations</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
